OL,3,ADemocrats hold first battleground
OL,4,ASenate seat as several key races remain
OL,5,Atoo close to call
OL,6,
OL,7,FDemocratic Senator Jon Ossoff is
OL,8,Fre-elected in Georgia, in the first
OL,9,Fmajor result of the midterms - see
OL,10,Fresults as they come in across the US
OL,12,FSeveral key Senate races - Florida,
OL,13,FMaine, Ohio and South Carolina - are
OL,14,Fstill too close to call, our partner
OL,15,FCBS says
OL,17,FWhat's up for election? All 435 seats
OL,18,Fin the House; 35 of the 100 seats in
OL,19,Fthe Senate; and some state-level
OL,20,Fpoliticians, including governors
