OL,3,ADemocrats hold first battleground
OL,4,ASenate seat as several key races remain
OL,5,Atoo close to call
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhat does each side need to do to win?
OL,8,FTrump's Republican Party currently
OL,9,Fcontrols the House and the Senate.
OL,10,FDemocrats need a net gain of four seats
OL,11,Fto take the Senate, and three to take
OL,12,Fthe House
OL,14,FMeanwhile, in a major poll, most voters
OL,15,Fsay they are unhappy with the economy;
OL,16,Fthe survey may give Democrats some
OL,17,Fcomfort - for now, our North America
OL,18,Fcorrespondent writes
